# Dev only — Vite loads this in `vite dev`, never in `vite build`.
#
# The ad-hoc room links this page hands out are same-origin in production,
# which is the whole one-origin deal (see GOOMBA_URL in src/AdhocRooms.tsx).
# `npm run dev` serves each app on its own port instead, so without this the
# Copy button would produce a link on the proctor's port.
VITE_GOOMBA_URL=http://localhost:5178/g00mBa/
